  <item>
    <title>插话会 049 | 最近想的听的看到的事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c2bffc2c82c9dccae0c6ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c2bffc2c82c9dccae0c6ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Sep 2025 12:33:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哎！突然出现更新啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">00:02:22</a> 新面貌的男性应该呈现什么状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">00:03:38</a> 女性是生活的主导者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">00:05:26</a> 女生在哪儿就在哪儿站稳脚跟了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">00:09:25</a> 女性是家的创造者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">00:14:05</a> 聊聊今年的脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1112">00:18:32</a> 房主任没必要解释和澄清任何东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">00:19:38</a> 被王小利震撼到了，大聊王小利，喜欢王小利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">00:35:00</a> 腾讯第二轮就把女的淘汰了一大批</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">00:38:26</a> 女演员们的线下脱口秀非常精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">00:48:57</a> 李宇春！李宇春！李宇春！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3810">01:03:30</a> 鲁豫老师开始正视自己的才华</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">01:24:00</a> 夸夸嘻哈和王越</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5486">01:31:26</a> 爱奇艺那边还是没有女生冠军吗？（这是赶在周四发布本期播客的原因）</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《Nessuno》- Petra Magoni&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@司加力</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP6VdZsBY4ukLZcURW3YotmXe1o.png"></figure>]]></description>
