  <item>
    <title>插话会 048 | 我从来不欣赏他的幽默</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6875319160f8f77d4080fbd8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6875319160f8f77d4080fbd8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“这玩笑你也开不起？太敏感了吧！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“大家不是都这样吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“就是个笑话而已，别上纲上线！”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>······</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们从讨论春天（是的，如今已经是夏天了hhh）翻红的《道格拉斯被取消了》开始，聊聊隐藏在生活对话中的语言“特权”，这些轻描淡写的语言如何一步步越界，并让女性在表达反对时承担额外的社交成本与风险，我们又如何识别和反击。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">0:23</a> &nbsp;"cancel"到底要怎么翻译</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">05:12</a> &nbsp;男人幽默感的show time</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="348">05:48</a> 糟糕的线下听秀经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 绿帽梗的本质是客体化女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 广告中的调侃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1449">24:09</a> 解构“女人三十如狼，四十如虎。”的幽默</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 剧透预警</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《我从来不懂你的幽默》-杨乃文 &nbsp;@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@Mila</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP6VdZsBY4ukLZcURW3YotmXe1o.png"></figure>]]></description>
