  <item>
    <title>插话会 047 | 再聊消费观</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681af3c9db57cd35f7f1aa6f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681af3c9db57cd35f7f1aa6f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 May 2025 06:00:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>回到久违的消费话题，这一期我们从越来越热的”消费降级“开始，分享自己和身边正在发生的降级体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>降级就意味着生活质量的降低吗？在学习平替后，我们惊喜地发现泾渭分明的“自我需求”和“社会告诉我的需求”，也更加厘清消费背后的对性别刻画的差异。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 朋友出国都开始带被窝卷了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 小问号的消费降级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 松饼：我再也不买优速通了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 司佳力的闲鱼心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1545">25:45</a> 米拉居然被电信诈骗了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2034">33:54</a> 我不创造需求了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> 菲菲：主体性来临之路阿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2671">44:31</a> 小问号：穿搭给我的生活积极地正反馈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> 阿包：恶心穿搭能让我去哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3104">51:44</a> 羊又：自己购物做饭的新奇体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">61:01</a> 令人难过的男性好友穿搭小游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4216">70:16</a> 羊又：女性的收入第二次高峰在退休以后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4637">77:17</a> 男的不要来随便评论我们的衣着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4698">78:18</a> 小彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《Price tag》-Jessie J @小问号</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@小问号</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmP6VdZsBY4ukLZcURW3YotmXe1o.png"></figure>]]></description>
