    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fbd8de623bc78c3964998d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如题，本期是大家关于日常追剧看书看演出的部分分享。是忙碌的学习和工作之后，我们必需的背景音和暂停键。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">00:02:13</a> 辣椒的线下演出推荐：在这样的环境下能熬出来的女明星都有强大的生命力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">00:09:45</a> 辣椒讲了圈内秘密，又让我们剪了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">00:12:52</a> 菲菲刷剧的要求是不要让她动脑子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">00:28:00</a> 小问号深耕韩剧领域多年，推荐一些好看的韩剧如《善意的竞争》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2358">00:39:18</a> 小问号和菲菲推荐《国色芳华》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2775">00:46:15</a> 日剧《热点》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3390">00:56:30</a> 阿包推荐国产剧《滤镜》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4099">01:08:19</a>司佳力推荐小说《我才不想做家务》</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《Nessuno》- Petra Magoni/Ferruccio &nbsp;&nbsp;@小问号</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@司加力</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，欢迎在评论区写下你喜欢的书影音，共同分享，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjUBpK5Bec2e3RGgA9vSl9p5EvMH.png"></figure>]]></description>
