    <title>插话会 043 | 魔法游乐园</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b095ab606e5c5940a51879</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b095ab606e5c5940a51879</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Feb 2025 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人在什么地方可以不吃不喝全然沉浸在快乐里，快乐又可以有多少种形式，兴奋、放肆、恐惧、眩晕···都可以放进小熊的蜜罐里。</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛇年第一期，和我们一起聊聊游乐园魔力，开心与不开心都没关系~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a> &nbsp;80后小时候的游乐场什么样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">00:06:26</a> 大家小时候看过米老鼠动画片吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">00:16:36</a> 小时候玩的泡泡池</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1188">00:19:48</a> 欢乐谷的大摆锤太吓人了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">00:24:08</a> 广州塔的跳楼机更吓人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">00:29:24</a> 悬挂式过山车不敢坐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">00:34:18</a> 人年纪大了就开始害怕各种游乐园项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2724">00:45:24</a> 迪士尼最吓人的是抱抱龙还是创极速光轮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">00:57:24</a> 大阪环球影城的万圣节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4349">01:12:29</a> 和闺蜜一起去迪士尼是最好的</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《游乐场) 》谢霆锋</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@司加力</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjUBpK5Bec2e3RGgA9vSl9p5EvMH.png"></figure>]]></description>
