    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>年关将至，祝姐妹们拼荆斩棘！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">00:01:16</a> &nbsp;年会到底是什么样的存在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">00:07:05</a> 女同事表演旗袍秀男同事表演什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">00:21:20</a> 年会抽奖环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">00:26:27</a> 年会敬酒环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">00:30:16</a> 年会颁奖环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">00:40:10</a> 酒桌文化是服从性测试</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">00:44:00</a> 领导喜欢观察下属，剧本杀团建观察大家的反应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3630">01:00:30</a> 年会和团建是大型的异化现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">01:05:30</a> &nbsp;将团建事件娱乐化以掩盖霸凌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a> 职场要搞好人际关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5120">01:25:20</a> 消失的工作和年会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6205">01:43:25</a> 希望大家以后都不用参加年会</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《We Can't Stop》 Miley Cyrus</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@半夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@菲菲 画的！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjUBpK5Bec2e3RGgA9vSl9p5EvMH.png"></figure>]]></description>
