  <item>
    <title>插话会 037 | 我女，我不擅长</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6767c18c1e823e72d3c2406f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6767c18c1e823e72d3c2406f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Dec 2024 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>路痴、女司机、生活小白、感性无脑、理科全盲......</span></p><span></span><p><span>女性的社会形象总是被各种不擅长的标签构成，而我们擅长的就只能是温柔、体贴和为别人做饭。今天我们就来聊一聊这些被定义的“不擅长”的事儿！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 第一件事就是不擅长开场</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 我女，我仅代表我自己路痴</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> 女司机是非常标签化和污名化女性的一个名词</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1760">29:20</a> 是谁不擅长唱歌啦！插话会第一届歌王争霸赛！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 是我们不擅长，还是我们在以高标准要求自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2613">43:33</a> 是我不擅长吗，是教练不会教</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 我特别擅长去竞争</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3459">57:39</a> 我特别能接受失败</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 我特别擅长辩论</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4280">1:11:20</a> 我特别擅长理科</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4890">1:21:30</a> 女性可以擅长任何职业</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/upload?userType=3#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4980">1:23:00</a> 我们女的什么都很擅长</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>| 背景音乐：《看我七十二变》蔡依林 and 菲菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期剪辑：@桂花 &nbsp;@菲菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>| 本期封面：@阿包</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于本期我们讨论的话题正在收听的你是否也有想要讨论或表述的想法，欢迎加入我们插话会的播客群 vx:Chahuahui25，只限女生哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目就到这里，我们下期再会！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyVfUUEvcYTzUulcLShU-cq72SE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>感谢收听!</span></p>]]></description>
