  <item>
    <title>插话会 035 | 值得三刷四刷的《好东西》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67559441bdb9877a973bf730</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67559441bdb9877a973bf730</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 12:51:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a>辣椒：王铁梅是我的赛博妈咪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a>司佳力：好东西是一个很新的电影形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a>小问号：建立新规则是从更“传统”的小叶嘴里说出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="888">14:48</a>大三：王铁梅和小叶呈现了不同的没有雌竟的人物形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a>司佳力：铁梅这样的母亲我身边就有例子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1381">23:01</a>小问号：我与小叶高度共情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">27:05</a>羊又：像王铁梅给小叶一样给女性一点成长的时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a>大三：真诚是女性友谊中很珍贵的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a>羊又：张家鑫的妈妈是一个典型的家庭妇女形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a>蕾蕾：美化后的男性角色让男性白白吃了红利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">43:21</a>大家：餐桌雄竟片段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a>司佳力：你们不过是你我们的课间十分钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">52:20</a>小问号：某平台一星评论鉴赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3402">56:42</a>辣椒：某知名人士爹味长文鉴赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">1:00:05</a>蕾蕾：邵导超绝执行力夸夸</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：片头：The Story -Brandi Carlile，电影《幸运符》片尾曲/片尾：好东西-蔡依林 &nbsp;@小问号 推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面：@阿包 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本期剪辑：@小问号</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家加入我们的听友群：Chahuahui25</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjyVfUUEvcYTzUulcLShU-cq72SE.png"></figure>]]></description>
